[l_english.MODULE_ENGINE_5A_STORM]
Storm Engine

[l_english.MODULE_ENGINE_5A_STORM_desc]
The Storm Engine sacrifices price and stability for speed, so use it with caution to avoid overloading the engine and blowing it to pieces — just like its previous owner.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ENGINE_5A_STORM]
风暴引擎

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ENGINE_5A_STORM_desc]
风暴引擎牺牲了价格和稳定性来确保速度，所以谨慎地使用，避免过载的引擎炸成碎片——像它曾经的主人一样。
